# Screen tour: every main screen shows its "?" button (top app bar,
# right side), which opens the right offline help topic. Run AFTER
# installing a build with the help scaffold (HelpContent.kt + AppContent
# "?" action). EXPECTs use topic-unique section headers, never titles
# (some titles equal screen titles and prove nothing).
# Drawer toggle is icon-only: TAP_AT 49 110, proven open by EXPECT User Manual.
# Screens without drawer entries (Terminal, Tool Permission Settings)
# are reached via Toolbox cards / Settings rows; BACK counts differ there.

TAP_AT 49 110
EXPECT User Manual
TAP AI Chat
MAYBE_TAP New Chat
EXPECT Enter your question
SAVEDUMP screen_chat
TAP ?
SCROLL_TO UP Model row and toggles
EXPECT Model row and toggles
BACK
BACK

TAP_AT 49 110
EXPECT User Manual
TAP Memory Base
EXPECT Memory Base
SAVEDUMP screen_memory
TAP ?
SCROLL_TO UP Graph canvas
EXPECT Graph canvas
BACK
BACK

